    why2: "Iron overload begins after repeated red cell transfusions over time. Ferritin, liver iron concentration and cardiac MRI guide chelation.",
    types: [["Liver iron overload", "Liver scarring."], ["Cardiac iron overload", "Heart failure and arrhythmia."], ["Endocrine iron overload", "Diabetes, low thyroid, low sex hormones."]],
