      ["Delayed TRALI (proposed)", "Lung injury beginning 6 to 72 hours after transfusion has been described in critically ill patients but falls outside the standard 6-hour definition."],
      ["Donor mitigation context", "Using plasma mainly from male donors and screening female apheresis platelet donors for HLA antibodies has lowered immune TRALI rates."]
