          dose: [["Cardiac arrest, IV", "300 mg after the third shock, further 150 mg after the fifth shock"], ["Arrhythmias, IV infusion", "5 mg/kg over 20 to 120 minutes (central line preferred), then up to 1.2 g in 24 hours"], ["Oral loading", "200 mg three times daily for 1 week, then twice daily for 1 week, then usually 200 mg daily or less"]],
